    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450750/extras/aff0513a3d3c2ac3b22d97ad690e4125.avif?t=1686846239\" /></span><br><br>Get ready to exercise your brain and embark on an unforgettable journey with <i>Yume Memory</i>, the ultimate Match Two memory game! <br>Immerse yourself in a captivating gameplay experience as you uncover a dazzling array of colorful tiles. Your mission? Unleash your memory power and match pairs of identical tiles in the fastest time possible.<br><br>Match two cards with the same image together to receive two points. If the cards do not match lose one point.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>- Original Anime Style Chibi Art of 11 Characters from the Yume Creations Universe<br>- Chill with relaxing LoFi Background Music<br>- Highscore System<br>- Can be played only with a mouse<br>- 1920x1080 HD Resolution<br>- Endless Playmode<br>- Windows and Linux<br>- Achivements",
